4. Privacy

The Software stores activity data locally on your device. The Author does not receive this data. The optional local API is disabled by default and serves only the loopback address of the device after you enable it. You are responsible for the data the Software records, including compliance with data protection laws (such as Regulation (EU) 2016/679) if you use it on devices of other people.

